 booking for the full period; hourly queries return only equipment with an hourly price. Omit `kind` to
 search boards and sails together.
 
+Use `cancel(bookingId, at)` to cancel a booking at a UTC hour. It returns the booking ID and the
+euro-cent refund for the unused proportion of the booked period, rounded to the nearest cent. A
+cancellation before the booking begins refunds its full price; one after it ends refunds zero. A
+cancelled booking immediately releases its equipment, and cannot be cancelled again.
+
