+---
+id: task-005-cancel-rental-bookings
+type: task
+title: "Cancel rental bookings"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It must cancel an existing booking exactly once,
+release its equipment from availability checks, and return the booking ID plus the euro-cent refund for
+the unused proportion of the booking at the supplied UTC-hour time. Cancellation before the booked
+period refunds its whole price; cancellation after it refunds zero. Reject unknown booking IDs,
+invalid cancellation times, and repeat cancellations.
